	('ui_text_6499', 0, 6499, 'Resurrect using #@resurrect_buff@# effect'),
	('ui_text_6445', 0, 6445, '<font:??><size:10><b>- Asura Job Choices</b><br><b>First Job Choices:</b><br><b>Warrior Type:</b><br><b>Strider</b><br>Striders all have fast attacks and excellent agility.  They specialize in either dual swords/daggers or crossbows.<br><b>Magician Type:</b><br><b>Dark Magician</b><br>Dark Magicians focus on heavy hitting direct damage Fire and Shade spells.<br><b>Summoner Type:</b><br><b>Sorcerer</b><br>Sorcerers have abilities that focus on giving their pets powerful attacks.<br><br><b>Second Job Choices:</b><br><b>Warrior Types:</b><br><b>Assassin</b><br>Assassins use dual swords/daggers.  They have the ability to vanish from sight.<br><b>Shadow Hunter</b><br>Shadow Hunters have a wide range of skills that involve with crossbows.<br><b>Magician Types:</b><br><b>Chaos Magician</b><br>Chaos Magicians are incredibly powerful magicians with strong Direct Damage and AOE spells.<br><b>Warlock</b><br>Warlocks have strong debuffs and can set magical traps.<br><b>Summoner Type:</b><br><b>Battle Summoner</b><br>Battle Summoners can greatly enhance their pets combat ability.'),
