	('ui_text_6535', 0, 6535, '<#fec530><hcenter><vcenter>Buy Now price'),
	('ui_text_6536', 0, 6536, '<hcenter><vcenter><#242424><size:10>Curent bid price'),
	('ui_text_6447', 0, 6447, '<font:??><size:10><B>- Gaia Job Choices</B><br><b>First Job Change</b><br><B>Warrior Type:</b><br><b>Fighter</b><br>Fighters excel in melee combat with large weapons and with using bows.<br><b>Magician Type:</b><br><b>Kahuna</b><br>Kahunas are spell casters who use nature type magic and heavy melee weapons.<br><b>Summoner Type:</b><br><B>Spell Singer</b><br>Spell Singers have amazing creature buffs.<br><br><b>Second Job Change</b><br><B>Warrior Types:</b><br><b>Champion</b><br>Champions have excellent melee combat abilities.<br><b>Archer</b><br>Archers specialize in using bows.<br><b>Magician Types:</b><br><b>Druid</b><br>Druids have a mix of offensive and defensive nature magic and have strong melee abilities.<br><b>Battle Kahuna</b><br>Battle Kahunas have both offensive and defensive spells.<br><b>Summoner Type:</b><br><b>Evoker</b><br>Evokers have powerful pet buffs.'),
