	('name_itemtooltip_20806806', 0, 20806806, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Limit Level : 120<BR><SIZE:4><BR><size:10>Epic type Soul stone<br><size:4><br><size:10>#@bitset_text@#<size:4><BR><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20940000', 0, 20940000, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>When combined with the Bottle of Seal, one of Fairy\'s Bottle or Fairy Godmother\'s Bottle can be obtained.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20940001', 0, 20940001, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>When combined with Feather of Space, one of Feather of Return, Feather of Summon, or Feather of Union can be obtained.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20950003', 0, 20950003, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>This is a package of 3 Augmentations of Chaos, 3 Compositions of Chaos, and 3 Reinforcements of Chaos. Can only be used to upgrade your Chaos Stone necklace from Lv1 to Lv10. <br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20950004', 0, 20950004, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Combine with Rank 2 Strike Cube. You get a "Rank 2 Ancient Strike Cube" which has a 30% greater chance of success than a normal Strike Cube.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20950005', 0, 20950005, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Combine with Rank 3 Strike Cube. You get a "Rank 3 Ancient Strike Cube" which has a 30% greater chance of success than a normal Strike Cube.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
