	('name_itemtooltip_20812104', 0, 20812104, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Used for Item Creation.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20812105', 0, 20812105, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Used for Item Creation.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900000', 0, 20900000, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Recovers some stamina, and makes you consume no stamina for 1 hour when hunting.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900001', 0, 20900001, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases maximum stamina if it is in your inventory, and recovers stamina quicker anywhere in the village or field. Usable for 7 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900002', 0, 20900002, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases maximum stamina if it is in your inventory, and recovers stamina quicker anywhere in the village or field. Usable for 14 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20920006', 0, 20920006, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Resets a creature\'s skills and JP by refunding the cost of all trained skills.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20930020', 0, 20930020, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Included 2 Stamina Saver.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20930021', 0, 20930021, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Included 2 Fairy in a Bottle.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900003', 0, 20900003, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases maximum stamina if it is in your inventory, and recovers stamina quicker anywhere in the village or field. Usable for 30 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900004', 0, 20900004, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases maximum stamina if it is in your inventory, and recovers stamina quicker anywhere in the village or field. Usable for 90 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900010', 0, 20900010, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Recovers some stamina, and makes you consume no stamina for 1 hour when hunting. Not for sale. Cannot be traded with other characters. <br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900011', 0, 20900011, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Recovers some stamina, and makes you consume no stamina for 1 hour when hunting.<P>"Congratulations for your Class Transfer!"<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900012', 0, 20900012, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>When placed in the inventory, Max Stamina increases, and the Stamina recover rate increases.  Use up to 7 days.<P>"Congratulations for your Class Transfer!"<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20900100', 0, 20900100, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Maximum stamina increases and stamina is recovered faster in villages or fields when kept in the Inventory.  Valid for an hour. For Testing. <br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910000', 0, 20910000, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>A membership card that enables you to use the services provided by the Hidden Village for free. Usable for 30 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910001', 0, 20910001, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Membership admissions card to access and use the Hidden Village\'s services with no limit.  Valid for 90 days.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910002', 0, 20910002, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 30 points.This item is available for limited time at any time. (limited time item)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910003', 0, 20910003, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 50 points.This item is available for limited time at any time. (limited time item)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910004', 0, 20910004, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Able to revive without others\' help.  Loss of Experience by death is slightly recovered.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910005', 0, 20910005, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Able to revive without others\' help.  Loss of Experience by death is completely recovered. <br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910006', 0, 20910006, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Teleport to Save Point and return to original location if return is ordered within 4 hours.  Cannot use during battle.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910007', 0, 20910007, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Able to summon a Party Member to your location.  Canceled if the summoned member rejects it.  Cannot be used in Hidden Village or during raid or siege.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20920001', 0, 20920001, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Recovers Experience that decreases when creature dies and fills HP and MP to the top.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20920002', 0, 20920002, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Reduces Immorality points by 500.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20920003', 0, 20920003, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Removes your Immorality points.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20920004', 0, 20920004, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>When used it will change the name of your summoned tamed creature.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910008', 0, 20910008, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Able to summon all Party Members to your location.  Canceled if any one of the summoned members reject it. Cannot be used in Hidden Village or during raid or siege.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910009', 0, 20910009, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Teleports you to the place where the Feather of Return was used.<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 5<br>Return to : #@location_name@#'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910010', 0, 20910010, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 30 points.This item is available for limited time at any time. (limited time item)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910011', 0, 20910011, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 50 points.This item is available for limited time at any time. (limited time item)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910012', 0, 20910012, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 30 points. Consumed only when you are logged in.(time limit)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
	('name_itemtooltip_20910013', 0, 20910013, '<b><size:13>#@itemname@#</b><br><size:4><br><size:10>Increases your movement speed while mounted by 30 points. Consumed only when you are logged in.(time limit)<br><size:4><br><size:10>Weight : 1'),
