	('name_skilltooltip_002311', 0, 40002311, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Arrow of Delay Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A ranged attack that\'s aimed at the target\'s legs to cause damage and decrease Mov Spd momentarily. Requires a bow.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002312', 0, 40002312, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Heat Shot Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Shoots a flaming arrow at the target to cause damage over time for 10 sec. Requires a bow.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002313', 0, 40002313, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Spiracle Shock Shot Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Shoots a spiracle, causing damage, knocks the opponent back, and stuns them momentarily. Works with bows only.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002315', 0, 40002315, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Freezing Arrow Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Launches a freezing spiracle causing damage and immobilizing the target. Works with bows only. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002321', 0, 40002321, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Resonance Shockwave Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Ranged Air Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Consumes three spiracles to shoot stun arrows at a target and the enemies around it. Bows Only.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
