	('name_skilltooltip_002012', 0, 40002012, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Stun Mace Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A powerful blow that will sometimes stun the target for up to 4 seconds. Mace only.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002013', 0, 40002013, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Stun Mace Perfection Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A powerful blow that will usually stun the target for up to 6 seconds. Mace only.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002014', 0, 40002014, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Divine Cross Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An attack which hits the target twice in a cross pattern.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002018', 0, 40002018, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Shield Smash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A shield only skill that provokes the target while also increasing your threat level.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
