	('name_skilltooltip_002021', 0, 40002021, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Defense Breaker Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An attack which weakens the target\'s defense power and causes damage to the enemy.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002022', 0, 40002022, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Mental Breaker Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Damages an enemy and temporarily weakens their magic defense.  A small amount of MP is recovered upon a successful hit. Axe, Dirk, Mace, Spear, or Sword only. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002031', 0, 40002031, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Charge Stab Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An attack skill which gathers power and stabs the target with a strong thrust.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002032', 0, 40002032, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Dark Strike Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Deals three consecutive hits, causing damage to the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002033', 0, 40002033, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Bloody Blade Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A slash attack which transfers some HP from the target to yourself.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002034', 0, 40002034, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Head Breaker Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Strikes the target\'s head, causing damage and causing fear to the target for a certain period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
