	('name_skilltooltip_002041', 0, 40002041, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Spinning Blow Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Build up centrifugal force to attack a target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002043', 0, 40002043, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Storming Serial Cut Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Three consecutive cross slashes which strike the opponent with wind and lightning. Causes massive damage and stuns target. Requires Dual Axes.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002044', 0, 40002044, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Log Split Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An attack that vertically slices the enemy, causing damage and reducing defense power momentarily. Requires a two-handed axe or dual axes.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002045', 0, 40002045, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Wind Cut Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A powerful attack that inflicts deep cuts that sting in the air, causing air damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002046', 0, 40002046, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Blasting Rock Cut Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack Skill. A powerful hit that stuns the target. One-hand, Two-hand, or Dual Axes only.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 1min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002051', 0, 40002051, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Dirk Tornado Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A dirk only skill that allows you to move as fast as a tornado and continously attack your target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
