	('name_skilltooltip_002340', 0, 40002340, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Cascade of Darkness Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack all enemies in the target area by shooting a cascade of arrows at the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002501', 0, 40002501, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Double Impact Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A skill which gives you the chance of performing two successive attacks with a one-handed long sword or dirk. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002502', 0, 40002502, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Assassin Impact Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44> Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A revelation skill which gives you a chance to perform 2 successive attacks with dual swords or dual dirks.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
