	('name_skilltooltip_002601', 0, 40002601, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Deep Evasion Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A revelation skill to greatly increase evasion for a short time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002602', 0, 40002602, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Mental Concentration Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A revelation skill which greatly increases Cri Hit momentarily.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002611', 0, 40002611, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Active Guard Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A skill which increases block percentage for a certain period of time. Effective only when wearing a shield.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
