	('name_skilltooltip_002615', 0, 40002615, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Godly Protection Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Greatly reduces the amount of damage received for a certain period of time while also reducing attack speed by half. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min 30sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002616', 0, 40002616, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Icicle Snare Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Trap Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Set a trap that when activated will freeze nearby enemies. Targets that are frozen are unable to act. Physical defense on the target increases while magical defense is lowered. There is a chance that the target may thaw upon being hit.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002617', 0, 40002617, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Snare of Lightning Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Trap Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Set a trap that when triggered causes pulsing lightning damage to targets within range.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002620', 0, 40002620, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Defect Aiming Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases critical rate of basic attacks for a certain period of time.  Can be used with crossbows only. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002621', 0, 40002621, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Concentration Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A skill which increases accuracy for a certain period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
