	('name_skilltooltip_002641', 0, 40002641, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Energy Charge Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Use spiracles to recover a small amount of HP and MP. Amount of spiracles required is based on skill level.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002642', 0, 40002642, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Spiracle of Vitality Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Use spiracles to increase vitality. Amount of spiracles required is based on skill level.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002645', 0, 40002645, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Loading Restrain Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Has a chance to briefly hold target in place. Requires a Longbow.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002649', 0, 40002649, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Blinding Dust Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Blinds the target for a short time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_002655', 0, 40002655, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Essence of Fire Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Consumes 5 Spiracles to imbue your melee weapon with fire, which will make it deal additional fire damage during basic attacks.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
