	('name_skilltooltip_003001', 0, 40003001, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Divine FlareLv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack Skill. A flare of divine light shoots up from the ground below your target. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 1min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003002', 0, 40003002, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Flash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attacks the target with the forces of light to blind it and decrease its accuracy for a period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003003', 0, 40003003, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Frozen Snare Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Holds the target with a frozen snare and causes Water damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003004', 0, 40003004, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Shining Buster Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack spell which magically damages your opponent with a series of powerful hits.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
