	('name_skilltooltip_003011', 0, 40003011, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Energy Beat Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A basic attack spell which damages the target with non-elemental energy.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skill_040466', 0, 50040466, 'Awakening: HP Regen<Stage 6 >'),
	('name_skill_040481', 0, 50040481, 'Awakening: MP Regen<Stage 1>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003012', 0, 40003012, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fireball Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A fireball attack spell that also causes Fire damage over time to the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
