	('name_skilltooltip_003015', 0, 40003015, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Darkness Arrow Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>Casting#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A devastating attack that shoots multiple bolts of dark energy at the enemy.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003016', 0, 40003016, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Lightning Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Drops lightning on the target\'s head, causing wind damage with the possibility of stunning the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
