	('name_skilltooltip_003021', 0, 40003021, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Scorching Flame Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Burns the target, causing fire damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003022', 0, 40003022, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Chainsickle Wind Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Causes air damage to the target and has a chance to decrease Attack Speed and Movement Speed.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  45 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003023', 0, 40003023, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Shackle of the Ground Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Holds the target\'s feet with the forces of earth, stunning the enemy and causing damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003024', 0, 40003024, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Crystalizing Water Spheres Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Hits the target hard with condensed liquid spheres. If the target is stunned, they take additional damage.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  45 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003025', 0, 40003025, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Huge Rock Fall Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Area spell which causes rocks to fall on nearby enemies.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
