	('name_skilltooltip_003181', 0, 40003181, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Root of Mother Nature Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Holds a targeted group of enemies in place and also deals lasting damage.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003183', 0, 40003183, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Eternal Pillar of Fire Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Damages the target and enemies nearby using a pillar of fire.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003185', 0, 40003185, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fire Field Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Burn a large area around the target, causing fire damage over time to all the enemies in the area.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003186', 0, 40003186, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Heaven\'s Breaker Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Cast a lightning storm on a target, causing damage and stunning nearby targets.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003187', 0, 40003187, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Rain of the Spirits Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Casts an ethereal raincloud in a target area, damaging enemies and healing allies.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003188', 0, 40003188, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Vacuum Shockwave Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Damages the target and enemies nearby with a chance to silence them.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
