	('name_skilltooltip_003201', 0, 40003201, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Minor Healing Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Recover a small amount of the caster\'s HP. This spell cannot be used on others.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
