	('name_skilltooltip_003203', 0, 40003203, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Rapid Healing Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A healing spell that has a fast casting speed. The MP consumption rate is higher than that of a regular healing spell.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003204', 0, 40003204, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Clear Poison Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Removes poison from your target by purifying their body with holy light.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003205', 0, 40003205, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Resurrection Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A spell which resurrects the target. Recovers a part of the previous experience points lost due to the death.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
