	('name_skilltooltip_003210', 0, 40003210, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Restoration Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Recovers a percentage of the target\'s HP instantly and also heals additional HP over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
