	('name_skilltooltip_003224', 0, 40003224, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Essence of Life Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Recover the target\'s HP and the recovery lasts for a certain period.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
