	('name_skilltooltip_003426', 0, 40003426, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Enchant Weapon: Fire Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Self-Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Forms forces of fire around the caster, randomly applying additional damage to basic attacks. Does not stack with other application techniques.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
