	('name_skilltooltip_003430', 0, 40003430, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fireshield Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Self-Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A shield which randomly causes fire damage to anyone attacking the target with melee strikes.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003431', 0, 40003431, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Support of Gust Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Greatly increases the target\'s attack speed for a moment. Usable only on the caster or allies.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
