	('name_skilltooltip_003472', 0, 40003472, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Tears of Gaia Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Allows self-resurrection in case target becomes incapable of combat.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 1 hour<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003492', 0, 40003492, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Holy Aura Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Self-Buff Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Causes damage to nearby enemies for a certain period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003601', 0, 40003601, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Nightmare Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc> Puts the target to sleep. Their magic defense is weakened while they are asleep. Any damage will wake them.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003602', 0, 40003602, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Windy Shackle Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A curse spell to greatly decrease the target\'s attack speed by chaining it to a windy shackle.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
