	('name_skilltooltip_003810', 0, 40003810, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fear Trap Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summon an ethereal trap that explodes causing damage and panic.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 45sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003811', 0, 40003811, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Steadfast Shadowflame Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summon an ethereal flame trap at your feet that explodes and holds nearby enemies in place when it is triggered.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 45 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003814', 0, 40003814, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Spell Intercept Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A shield only attack skill that cancels the target\'s magical attacks.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 15 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_003815', 0, 40003815, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Hate Aura Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Debuff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Provokes nearby monsters to attack you.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
