	('name_skilltooltip_004001', 0, 40004001, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Summon Creature Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons the formed creature. You must first place the creature into your Creature Formation menu.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
