	('name_skilltooltip_004002', 0, 40004002, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Recall Creature Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Recalls the selected summoned creature.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004003', 0, 40004003, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creature Taming Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attempts to tame the selected monster. You need to have the proper type of creature card that corresponds with the target. If the tame fails, the card will be lost.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004012', 0, 40004012, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Pass Damage Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A toggle spell that has the creature take damage in place of the caster. MP keeps decreasing while using the spell.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004201', 0, 40004201, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creature Healing Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Quickly recovers the creature\'s HP, costing little MP for the caster.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004202', 0, 40004202, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creature Resurrection Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A healing spell that resurrects a creature and recovers a percentage of the experience lost due to its previous death.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004207', 0, 40004207, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Celestial Sanctuary Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Healing Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A healing spell that recovers the HP and MP of target player or creature.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 10 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_004211', 0, 40004211, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creature Soul Transfer Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Recovers the creature\'s MP by consuming caster\'s MP.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
