	('name_skilltooltip_014103', 0, 40014103, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Wizard Unit Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Passive#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases your creature\'s magic attack power when wearing a staff or blunt weapon.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_030106', 0, 40030106, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Pantera Blast Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A powerful melee attack that damages the target three times. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_030108', 0, 40030108, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Mortal Claw Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The creature bestows the rage of nature on his claws, greatly increasing critical hit probability for a short moment.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_030204', 0, 40030204, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Threatening Essence Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A Self-Buff Toggle that greatly increases the threat level of basic attacks while activated.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_030306', 0, 40030306, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Poultry Nightmare Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Puts the target asleep and gives it a nightmare for a period of time, decreasing his Magic Defense Power while sleeping.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_continuouseffectooltip_001515', 0, 60001515, '<B><#99ff66>Magical Power increases.<#ffffff></B><br><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffff>'),
	('name_continuouseffectooltip_002003', 0, 60002003, '<B><#99ff66>Absorbs HP <#ffffff></B><BR><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Chance of stealing HP with normal attacks.<br><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035101', 0, 40035101, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Focus Slash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Gathers the creature\'s strength to slice the target into pieces with a powerful slash.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035111', 0, 40035111, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Cross of Valhalla Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons forth a sacred cross of darkness from the halls of Valhalla. The attack continuously damages the target and all other enemies surrounding the Orc.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 min  <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035201', 0, 40035201, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Frost Smash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A high threat level attack by your Yeti, who takes his frozen weapon and smashes it on the target\'s head.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035206', 0, 40035206, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Yeti Slam Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A special body slam attack that uses the power of thunder in order to stun the target. Very high threat level.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2 min 30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035309', 0, 40035309, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Chaotic Flame Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A toggle skill that covers your creature in a flame of shadow, greatly increasing its attack speed but it also continuously receives Shade damage over time. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035408', 0, 40035408, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fairy Meteor Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons a meteor storm on the target and area around it that damages all enemies within the area for a certain amount of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min 30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
