	('name_skilltooltip_035601', 0, 40035601, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Painful Noise Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Creates a disgusting sound on the Siren\'s harp damaging the target with Holy damage over time and reducing his accuracy.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035602', 0, 40035602, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Serenade of Nightmare Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The Siren plays a dark but calming serenade which causes the target to fall asleep.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035606', 0, 40035606, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Painful Aria Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An Aria of darkness that causes great pain to the target with Shade damage over time. The physical defense and magic defense of the target is decreased for the duration of this song.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min 30 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035607', 0, 40035607, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Opera of Destruction Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The Siren plays an enraging Opera causing the target and all enemies within range to receive Fire damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035608', 0, 40035608, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Siren\'s Lullaby Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A lullaby with wide range that causes all enemies within the area to fall asleep and have a nightmare. Their magic defense is decreased for the duration of the nightmare.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035995', 0, 40035995, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Cleric Unit Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Passive#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases the creature\'s healing ability if it has a staff or mace equipped.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_035996', 0, 40035996, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Empower Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Passive#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases the Magic Power of the creature by 5 points per skill level.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>'),
