	('name_skilltooltip_036048', 0, 40036048, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Wings of Speed Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases your creature\'s movement speed for a short moment.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036049', 0, 40036049, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Body Slam Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Your creature rushes to the target and smashes it with the might of his entire body.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036050', 0, 40036050, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Poultry Scream Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A fierce scream that slows down the target for a period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036051', 0, 40036051, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Scratch Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Scratches the target twice.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 15 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036052', 0, 40036052, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Odin\'s Rage Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Greatly damages the target by using all gathered strength. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
