	('name_skilltooltip_036057', 0, 40036057, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Guardian Armor Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Bestows a guarding aura upon the creature, increasing its physical defense for a short period of time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036058', 0, 40036058, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Turtle Shell Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Bestows the strength of the creature\'s backplate upon the target, increasing the target\'s physical defense.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036059', 0, 40036059, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Iron Backplate Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The creature\'s backplate turns into strong iron, decreasing all damage received for a short time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036060', 0, 40036060, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Wound Lick Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>HP Recovery rate increases. All healing spells will have greater healing power for the duration of this Self-Buff.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036061', 0, 40036061, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Beak of Gaia Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A Self-Buff Toggle that bestows the energy of Gaia upon the creature\'s beak, increasing his attack power.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_continuouseffectooltip_004032', 0, 60004032, '<B><#99ff66>Poultry Potion Lasting Effect<#ffffff></B><BR><size:4><br><size:10><#ffffcc>P. Acc increases.<br><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffff>'),
