	('name_skilltooltip_036075', 0, 40036075, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Odin\'s Fury Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self- Buff#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Bestows the fury of Odin on the creature increasing its attack speed.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_continuouseffectooltip_001010', 0, 60001010, '<B><#99ff66>M. Def. increases <#ffffff></B><BR><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffff>'),
	('name_continuouseffectooltip_001011', 0, 60001011, '<B><#99ff66>Attack Speed increases <#ffffff></B><BR><size:4><BR><size:10><#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036076', 0, 40036076, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Thor\'s Slash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Slashes your target once with a weapon imbued by a bolt of lightning. Stuns the enemy.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036077', 0, 40036077, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Curse of Nocturn Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Curses the target with the wrath of Nocturn, decreasing its attack speed and attack power for a while.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 3 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036078', 0, 40036078, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Nocturn\'s Revenge Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Covers the creature in an aura of darkness that damages all those that attack the creature with physical attacks.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
