	('name_skilltooltip_036083', 0, 40036083, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Prisoner\'s Shackles Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Slows down the target\'s movement speed and casting speed by attaching heavy shackles to his feet.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>cooltime 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036084', 0, 40036084, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Odin\'s Sword Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons forth the Sword of Odin which your creature will use for one deadly blow, causing critical damage and putting the target to sleep.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
