	('name_skilltooltip_036086', 0, 40036086, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>??? ?? Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>??? ????#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>?? ?? ?? ???? ??? ???? ??<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>??? 1? <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036087', 0, 40036087, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Freezing Shockwave Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The creature strikes the ground with his weapon causing the ground below to crack and a cold shockwave fills the entire area, slowing down all enemies within it.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036088', 0, 40036088, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Call to Arms Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Mass Buff Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Motivates the party and increases their physical defense and heals some HP over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 2 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036089', 0, 40036089, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Breath of Ice Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Spellk#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Your creature shoots a cold breath of ice towards the target which damages it and also has a high chance to freeze it.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
