	('name_skilltooltip_036103', 0, 40036103, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Scream of Valhalla Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A scream emanates from the tortured souls of fallen warriors that damages and curses all enemies in the area, decreasing their physical defense and attack power.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
