	('name_skilltooltip_036109', 0, 40036109, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Efreet\'s Riot Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Damages the target and all enemies in the area continuously with a riot of fire.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036110', 0, 40036110, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Acumen Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Self-Buff#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases the casting speed of the creature.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036111', 0, 40036111, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Shadow Illusion Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Reduces the creature\'s threat level by trying to trick the enemy into attacking an illusion instead of the creature itself.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036112', 0, 40036112, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fairy Queen\'s Blessing Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Group Buff#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increases the HP and MP Regeneration of all party members.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036113', 0, 40036113, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Breath of Phoenix Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Greatly damages the target with a breath of fire that will also deal Fire damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036114', 0, 40036114, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Pixie Fireball Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The pixie conjures a giant fireball that will damage the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036115', 0, 40036115, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Twin Sphere Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>The Pixie focuses her spirit in order to shoot two spheres of magical energy at the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
