	('name_skilltooltip_036122', 0, 40036122, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Tears of Undine Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Prays to Undine and summons a healing rain of her tears which restores the HP of all targets within the area of effect.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036123', 0, 40036123, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Serenade of Undine Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons a whirlwind of water from the depths of the ocean that damages your target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 5 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036124', 0, 40036124, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Frozen Touch Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A hand from the depths of the ocean grabs the legs of the target, slowing down his movement.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036125', 0, 40036125, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Siren\'s Ballad Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A powerful cursed ballad that decreases the casting speed of the target.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036126', 0, 40036126, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Song of Embrace Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A song that summons arms of water that hold the enemy in place for a short time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036127', 0, 40036127, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Gift of Undine Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Grants the target a Blessing of Undine, restoring HP by a certain percentage and continuously recovering HP and MP for a while.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
