	('name_skilltooltip_036128', 0, 40036128, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Undine\'s Oasis Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Mass Healing Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summons forth an Oasis filled with holy water that heals the HP and MP of everyone within the area of effect.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>cooltime 1 hour <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036129', 0, 40036129, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Diabolic Ballad Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An evil ballad of darkness that hypnotizes the target and confuses it with illusions.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 20 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036130', 0, 40036130, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Symphony of Frost Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A symphony that controls the frost of the arctic in order to slow down the movement speed of all targets within range by 50% for the duration of the effect.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_036131', 0, 40036131, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Serenade of Silence Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Magic Curse Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A serenade that curses all enemies within range slowing down their casting speed by 50% for the duration of the effect.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
