	('name_skilltooltip_045901', 0, 40045901, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creation: Pantera Potion Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Creation Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Creates a consumable potion. When the potion is used, it gives the player a 1 hour buff that increases P. Atk. An empty bottle is required to create the potion. The potion will disappear from your inventory after 24 hours.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1 hour <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
