	('name_skilltooltip_063006', 0, 40063006, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fire Storm Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Call forth a firestorm that causes severe damage and fire damage over time to the target and enemies nearby.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  1 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063007', 0, 40063007, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Fire Arrow Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attacks the target with flaming arrows.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  1sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063008', 0, 40063008, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Lightning Bolt Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attacks the target with lightning.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  1sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063009', 0, 40063009, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Divine Flash Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack Skill. Inflicts damage on a target and temporarily blinds.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 1min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063010', 0, 40063010, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Judgment Buster Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Holy Attack Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Attack Skill. Causes an explosion of radiant light on your opponents which may also stun them.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 2min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
