	('name_skilltooltip_063012', 0, 40063012, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Rock Pin Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Causes damage by dropping rocks onto your opponents and pins them for a short period of time under the rocks. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  1 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063013', 0, 40063013, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Earthquake Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Causes the ground to rumble and shake, reducing movement speed and causing enemies in the area to take damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  20 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063014', 0, 40063014, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Snow Slide Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Water Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>An avalanche of snow seals all objects in the area. Non-hostile targets are released earlier than hostile targets.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063015', 0, 40063015, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Spear of Flame Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Ranged Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Throws a spinning spear of flame at a target and damages nearby targets.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  1 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063016', 0, 40063016, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Huge Volcanic Eruption Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Attack Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Magma erupts from the ground causing lasting fire damage in a large area.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  10 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063017', 0, 40063017, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Meteor Shower Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Drops small meteors continuously in a wide area and can cause panic to all enemies within the area.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  10 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
