	('name_skilltooltip_063403', 0, 40063403, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Shield of Revenge Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>A shield only skill that reflects a percentage of damage back onto the attacker.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime  10 min <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063404', 0, 40063404, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Blessing of Vitality Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Earth Buff Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Increase target\'s vitality and defense power for a certain time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cooltime 2 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
