	('name_skilltooltip_063605', 0, 40063605, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Corruption Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Darkness Attack Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Surrounds the target with wicked energy that does Shade damage over time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  15 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063801', 0, 40063801, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Explosion Trap Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Fire Trap Skill#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summon an ethereal trap at your feet that explodes and causes damage over time to nearby enemies when it is triggered. <#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1min 30sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_063802', 0, 40063802, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Lightning Trap Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Air Trap Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Summon an ethereal lightning trap at your feet that electrocutes and stuns nearby enemies when it is triggered.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time 1min 30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_064001', 0, 40064001, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Harmony of Life Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Harmonize with your creature and increase your HP and MP. Unable to summon creature during the lasting time.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  30 sec<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_064002', 0, 40064002, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Beast Disguise Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Self-Buff Spell#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Disguise yourself as an unidentified summoned creature. Moving speed is increased.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  15 min<#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
	('name_skilltooltip_064201', 0, 40064201, '<#17f39c><B><size:13>#@skill_enhance@#<#ffffff>Creature Life Transfer Lv#@level@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10>#@attribute_icon@#<OFFSET:44>MP #@mp@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_mp@#<#ffffff><OFFSET:200>#@casting_time@# <#17f39c>#@decrease_casting_time@#<BR><size:2><BR><size:10><#ffffff><OFFSET:44>Shade Healing Magic#@detail@#<BR><size:6><BR><size:10><#ffffcc>Absorbs a part of your own HP to heal the target creature.<#ffffff><BR><size:6><BR><size:10>Cool Time  5 sec <#17f39c>#@decrease_cooltime@#<#ffffff>'),
