	('script_string_90996100', 0, 90996100, 'Lonely Pumpkin Freddie<Laksy>'),
	('script_string_90996101', 0, 90996101, '<B>Lonely Pumpkin Freddie<Laksy></B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996102', 0, 90996102, 'Hi, do you know anything about Halloween Wonderland?'),
	('script_string_90996103', 0, 90996103, 'The Halloween Wonderland can only be visited during Halloween. There are a lot of fun things to do there! I\'d love to tell you more about it, but I\'m very lost, and cannot find my Pumpkin Lanterns!<BR> If you can find me 5 Pumpkin Lanterns, I will help you get to Halloween Wonderland. How\'s that sound? Do you want to help me? <BR> You should be able to obtain the Lanterns by killing any monsters that are around. I will be waiting patiently here for you. Please hurry though, as I don\'t have much time!'),
	('script_string_90996200', 0, 90996200, 'Lonely Pumpkin Chucky<Katan>'),
	('script_string_90996201', 0, 90996201, '<B>Lonely Pumpkin Chucky<Katan></B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996202', 0, 90996202, 'Hi, do you know how to get to Halloween Wonderland?'),
	('script_string_90996300', 0, 90996300, 'Lonely Pumpkin Drac<Trainees Island>'),
	('script_string_90996301', 0, 90996301, '<B>Lonely Pumpkin Drac<Trainees Island></B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996302', 0, 90996302, 'Hi I\'m Drac, do you know how to get to Halloween Wonderland?'),
	('script_string_90996400', 0, 90996400, 'Lonely Pumpkin Franken<Horizon>'),
	('script_string_90996104', 0, 90996104, 'I need five Pumpkin Lanterns.  I could get lost again if I have less than five lanterns.  All you have to do is hunt monsters to get those.  Do you not want to help me or are you scared of the monsters?'),
	('script_string_90996105', 0, 90996105, 'Wow you are the best! Thank you for your help in this task. Now I will be able to find my way to Halloween Wonderland.<br> Here, accept this secret key to Halloween Wonderland. This key is one of the two things you would need to get into Halloween Wonderland.  All you need now is an invitation.  You can obtain an invitation from the Halloween Gatekeeper who you will find around here somewhere. Show the Gatekeeper this key and he will certainly help get you to Halloween Wonderland.  Make sure to bring this key when you come.  I\'ll see you at Halloween Wonderland!'),
	('script_string_90996203', 0, 90996203, 'The Halloween Wonderland can only be visited during Halloween. There are a lot of fun things to do there! I\'d love to tell you more about it, but I\'m very lost, and cannot find my Pumpkin Lanterns!<BR> If you can find me 5 Pumpkin Lanterns, I will help you get to Halloween Wonderland. How\'s that sound? Do you want to help me? <BR> You should be able to obtain the Lanterns by killing any monsters that are around. I will be waiting patiently here for you. Please hurry though, as I don\'t have much time!'),
	('script_string_90996204', 0, 90996204, 'I need five Pumpkin Lanterns.  I could get lost again if I have less than five lanterns.  All you have to do is hunt monsters to get those.  Do you not want to help me or are you scared of the monsters?'),
