	('script_string_90996605', 0, 90996605, 'Wow you are the best! Thank you for your help in this task. Now I will be able to find my way to Halloween Wonderland.<br> Here, accept this secret key to Halloween Wonderland. This key is one of the two things you would need to get into Halloween Wonderland.  All you need now is an invitation.  You can obtain an invitation from the Halloween Gatekeeper who you will find around here somewhere. Show the Gatekeeper this key and he will certainly help get you to Halloween Wonderland.  Make sure to bring this key when you come.  I\'ll see you at Halloween Wonderland!'),
	('script_string_90996700', 0, 90996700, 'Halloween Gatekeeper<Common>'),
	('script_string_90996701', 0, 90996701, '<B>Halloween Gatekeeper<Common></B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996702', 0, 90996702, 'Who are you? <br> I guess there aren\'t that many Pumpkin Heads who are lost this year.'),
	('script_string_90996703', 0, 90996703, 'Who are you? Where did you get that key from? <br>  All those wandering Pumpkin Heads drive me crazy and you want me to help you out just because you helped one of them?  There is no way I’m helping you out.  Although, I might think about it if you bring me some sweet candies.  I used to go to Halloween Wonderland to get those sweet, delicious candies but I can’t go there anymore because I’m too old.  If you bring me a couple candies, I might be able to help you out.  You can get them from pretty much any monster out there right now, but be careful because they will not be given up without a fight!'),
	('script_string_90996704', 0, 90996704, 'You think I was joking?  I might be shabby but I am scary enough to appear in your nightmares.  Bring me the candies you promised me!!'),
	('script_string_90996705', 0, 90996705, 'Hmm… Not bad.  Let me have a quick taste of that candy.  It’s so good!  I want to pay you back for helping me out.  Bring me back the Halloween Wonderland Key, and I will give you an invitation to enter.  Just be aware that Halloween Wonderland is a twisted place. The monsters that dwell there are not like any you have ever seen. It will be a good idea to go there with a companion.  A weak person like you will not survive in that place alone. Good Luck, YOU WILL NEED IT!!'),
	('script_string_90996706', 0, 90996706, 'You really want to go?  Did you bring back the secret key?'),
	('script_string_90996707', 0, 90996707, 'You can’t go there without the secret key! '),
	('script_string_90996708', 0, 90996708, 'Teleport to Halloween Wonderland<test>'),
	('script_string_90996800', 0, 90996800, 'Teleporter Chewie'),
	('script_string_90996801', 0, 90996801, '<B>Teleporter Chewie</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996802', 0, 90996802, 'Hello, welcome to Halloween Wonderland.  Come see me if you want to return from where you came.'),
	('script_string_90996808', 0, 90996808, 'Teleport to Gaia World'),
	('script_string_90996810', 0, 90996810, 'Halloween Wonderland Channel'),
	('script_string_90996811', 0, 90996811, 'Channel'),
	('script_string_90996817', 0, 90996817, 'Halloween Wonderland provides channel service so you can better enjoy the adventures.  Also, if you have a friend who is playing in another channel, you can use this service to teleport yourself to that channel.'),
	('script_string_90996900', 0, 90996900, 'Glutinous Rice Cake Wholesaler'),
	('script_string_90996901', 0, 90996901, '<B>Glutinous Rice Cake Wholesaler</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996902', 0, 90996902, 'This is a big problem. We should do something.'),
	('script_string_90996903', 0, 90996903, 'I am a rice cake wholesaler taking care of manufacturing of glutinous rice cake to sales. I am here to deliver the glutinous rice cake following the convention to feed children with the glutinous rice cake in desire for them to grow healthy.   '),
	('script_string_90996904', 0, 90996904, 'All of the creature wind scroll was blown away on the way to here while I was taking a short nap..They should not forgive me if they know this!<p>I couldn\'t find it searching for it all over the place, but there was someone to see Monster take it. I, as just a rice cake seller, am not able to take it back from Monster.<p> Would you please ger the creature wind scroll back to me if you find it from Monster? If you collect 50 and get those back to me, I will never forget to reward it. Please!'),
	('script_string_90996905', 0, 90996905, 'Oh, thank you! It was hard, wasn\'t it? It\'s just a part of them. Hee, the rewards? Don’t worry. I din\'t forget it. Here it is, the thing that I promised. '),
	('script_string_90996906', 0, 90996906, 'I am sorry, but you have to bring total 50. I am asking for others, but if you don\'t collect 50, it is impossible to recover all. Sorry. '),
	('script_string_90996907', 0, 90996907, 'Who are you?'),
	('script_string_90996908', 0, 90996908, 'How may I help you?'),
	('script_string_90996909', 0, 90996909, 'Hand it 50 glutinous rice cake scroll'),
	('script_string_90996910', 0, 90996910, '??? ??'),
