	('script_string_90996920', 0, 90996920, '??? ?? ??? ?? ? ????.'),
	('script_string_90996921', 0, 90996921, 'Promotion Hostess'),
	('script_string_90996922', 0, 90996922, '<B>Promotion Hostess</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996923', 0, 90996923, 'Hello, Adventurer~!'),
	('script_string_90996924', 0, 90996924, 'I am the Hostess who is running the Prepaid Card Event.<br>To celebrate the opening of our prepaid cards in Target, we are running a special event!'),
	('script_string_90996925', 0, 90996925, 'Here is how the event works :<br>Buy a gPotato prepaid card at Target.  Go to our website and redeem the prepaid card for gPotatoes.  At the end of the redemption process, choose a Rappelz bonus item.  A special Coupon will be put in your Item Box!<br> Come back to me with that coupon, and tell me you want to "Redeem Coupon".  I will give you a Gift Box!<br> Open it. You will receive a prize!'),
	('script_string_90996926', 0, 90996926, 'Thank You!  You brought me a Prepaid Card Event Coupon. Here is a Prepaid Card Event Gift Box.'),
	('script_string_90996927', 0, 90996927, 'I am sorry, but you do not have a Prepaid Card Event Coupon.'),
	('script_string_90996928', 0, 90996928, 'Who are you?'),
	('script_string_90996929', 0, 90996929, 'What is The Prepaid Card Event?'),
	('script_string_90996930', 0, 90996930, 'Redeem Coupon'),
	('script_string_90996931', 0, 90996931, 'Teleporter Irioso'),
	('script_string_90996932', 0, 90996932, '<B>Teleporter Irioso</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996933', 0, 90996933, 'I am "Irioso"a twin of Teleporter Asmond.<BR>if you want to teleport please chhose area to move. if you pay, i can fly you wherever you want to go.'),
	('script_string_90996934', 0, 90996934, 'Teleporter Udindel'),
	('script_string_90996935', 0, 90996935, '<B>Teleporter Udindel</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996936', 0, 90996936, 'Ursa Caverns Manager Dominic'),
	('script_string_90996937', 0, 90996937, '<B>Ursa Caverns Manager Dominic</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996938', 0, 90996938, 'Greetings! My name is Dominic. I\'m here to help those who will find the origin of the evil that has corrupted our people.'),
	('script_string_90996939', 0, 90996939, 'I am one of the few people who have become one with the Ursa. Our people have been corrupted by an unknown evil. We have come here to seek aid in purging the evil that has plagued our home, Ursa Caverns. Will you help us?'),
	('script_string_90996940', 0, 90996940, 'Ursa Caverns is an underworld cave where we once lived in peace. One day our bear friends became ferocious and violent. A girl wearing a huge bear costume was using sorcery to control our friends! She must be a disciple of the evil Witch! She is turning our bear friends into creatures of evil, but we don\'t have the power to stop her. We can offer rewards to heroes like you for fighting her for us. So please gather your friends and battle the bears that she controls. Be careful inside, since any items you leave in Ursa Caverns will remain there forever. I can transport you to Ursa Caverns.'),
	('script_string_90996941', 0, 90996941, 'Enter Ursa Caverns'),
	('script_string_90996942', 0, 90996942, 'Sorry, but as much as it pains me to ask, I do require a small donation in order to assist you. Please collect 1,000 Rupee\'s and ask me again.'),
	('script_string_90996943', 0, 90996943, 'Who are you?'),
	('script_string_90996944', 0, 90996944, 'What is Ursa Caverns?'),
	('script_string_90996945', 0, 90996945, 'They say that the parameter is not right…'),
	('script_string_90996946', 0, 90996946, 'Sorry, it\'s too late to enter at this time. You need to enter before the entrance timer closes.'),
	('script_string_90996947', 0, 90996947, 'I can\'t find you to try to enter. It looks like there is some problem.'),
	('script_string_90996948', 0, 90996948, 'You can\'t enter because you belong to party right now. Please wait until the party is over. '),
	('script_string_90996949', 0, 90996949, 'Your status is pk on now. OK. Sorry but it is not quite a bit acceptable.'),
	('script_string_90996950', 0, 90996950, 'There is something wrong with Dominic\'s Idea.'),
	('script_string_90996951', 0, 90996951, 'Sorry but there is no dungeon composed suited to your idea yet. '),
	('script_string_90996952', 0, 90996952, 'Gen Point Vendor Cleo'),
	('script_string_90996953', 0, 90996953, '<B>Gen Point Vendor Cleo</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996954', 0, 90996954, 'It\'s been a long time since I\'ve been around so many people. What do you want from me?'),
	('script_string_90996957', 0, 90996957, 'Gen Point Shop'),
	('script_string_90996958', 0, 90996958, 'Who are you?'),
	('script_string_90996959', 0, 90996959, 'What are Gen Points?'),
	('script_string_90996967', 0, 90996967, '<B>Christmas Santa Girl</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90996968', 0, 90996968, 'Merry X-mas!! <BR> You have to collect all 4 types of Santa costumes if you want to have a merry Christmas. I will exchange them for a brand new 2008 Rudolph Item.'),
	('script_string_90996969', 0, 90996969, 'Here you go~ this is your Rudolph Costume, the best new icon of 2008.'),
	('script_string_90996970', 0, 90996970, 'This Santa Costume is not complete! You have to have all of them! Do not miss anything! How about checking if you equiped something.'),
	('script_string_90996955', 0, 90996955, 'I escaped from Ursa Caverns with Dominic to try to get help. I saved many treasures when we escaped. If you help us take back Ursa Caverns, I will give you the treasures I have. They are great for dressing up or improving your skills.'),
	('script_string_90996956', 0, 90996956, 'Gen Points are proof that you have fought the bears inside Ursa Caverns. You spend Gen Points instead of Rupees at the Gen Point Shop that I run. When your score in Ursa Caverns is high enough before time runs out, you will get Gen Points for your victory. I will trade you treasures for your Gen Points!'),
	('script_string_90999200', 0, 90999200, 'Baker Dunkins'),
	('script_string_90999201', 0, 90999201, '<B>Baker Dunkins</B><BR>'),
	('script_string_90999202', 0, 90999202, 'Happy Easter! I was going to do a good work to celebrate Easter, but some bad monster disturbed me. Can you give me a hand?'),
	('script_string_90999203', 0, 90999203, 'I will help you'),
	('script_string_90999204', 0, 90999204, 'bring a dish'),
	('script_string_90999205', 0, 90999205, 'Thank you for your help in the vertex of busy work... I\'m very thankful<br>I was going to share Easter dishes with my neighbor<br>but Monster had stolen my food ingredient last night<br>They went off with all things in the my storehouse.<br>Maybe monsters have<br>my food material of my Easter cooking.<br>Actually all my passion for cooking has run out  now<br>after my food was robbed by monster<br>I want to inform my special recipe of you guys<br>I will give my special recipe and you go for hunting monster<br>When you get food materials,<br>how about you cook by yourself?<br>It will helfgful to hunting.<br>….Hmm <br>I have another recipe but<br>I don\'t remember<br>You please look it up.<br>I wish you make a tasty food.<br>Well, if you succeed,<br>give me a norice!!<br>Ha ha ha ha ha!'),
	('script_string_90999206', 0, 90999206, 'What? Do you have anything to give me? I am thankful~'),
	('script_string_90999207', 0, 90999207, 'Give Easter 5 breads'),
	('script_string_90999208', 0, 90999208, 'Give Easter 5 eggs'),
	('script_string_90999209', 0, 90999209, 'Give Easter 5 steaks'),
	('script_string_90999210', 0, 90999210, 'Give Special 1 food'),
	('script_string_90999211', 0, 90999211, 'Hmm…there is no one…<br>Please make a delicious dishes next time…'),
	('script_string_90999212', 0, 90999212, 'Ohh~ how tasty it is. Thank you very much for this kind of delicious cooking<br>I have special gifts for you…<br>Hmm…Where is it…<br>Here it is…<br>This is the treasure chest that I keep for a long time <br>I don\'t know what kind of things pops up. But I\'m sure<br>it is very precious for you??<br>Please keep my gifts. …'),
